    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Virtual pet dragon! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dragon egg is waiting just for you! Choose who to bring home and take care of your new companion to make it grow bigger and fiercer.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/3d77de9872f54d6a76bb0aa7259b95d7.poster.avif?t=1752244843\" width=620 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/3d77de9872f54d6a76bb0aa7259b95d7.webm?t=1752244843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini Games! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dragon loves to play! Earn coins and beat your high scores together. Unlock new mini-games as your dragon grows!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/fb4e5c1fe7e25483096c7486c70a6c9a.poster.avif?t=1752244843\" width=620 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/fb4e5c1fe7e25483096c7486c70a6c9a.webm?t=1752244843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fidget toys! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bored at work? With the wide range of toys available in your backpack you will always find something to do. Combine multiple toys for a real sandbox experience.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/194641735156e1d34cafb8057daf9989.poster.avif?t=1752244843\" width=620 height=159 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/194641735156e1d34cafb8057daf9989.webm?t=1752244843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends for a playdate and watch your screen come to life. Unlock multiplayer mini games. Compete with and against your friends and their dragons.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/617662d3c3f6bda793834272ccbf59dc.poster.avif?t=1752244843\" width=620 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/617662d3c3f6bda793834272ccbf59dc.webm?t=1752244843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Virtual pet dragon! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dragon egg is waiting just for you! Choose who to bring home and take care of your new companion to make it grow bigger and fiercer.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/3d77de9872f54d6a76bb0aa7259b95d7.poster.avif?t=1752244843\" width=620 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/3d77de9872f54d6a76bb0aa7259b95d7.webm?t=1752244843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini Games! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dragon loves to play! Earn coins and beat your high scores together. Unlock new mini-games as your dragon grows!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/fb4e5c1fe7e25483096c7486c70a6c9a.poster.avif?t=1752244843\" width=620 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/fb4e5c1fe7e25483096c7486c70a6c9a.webm?t=1752244843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fidget toys! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bored at work? With the wide range of toys available in your backpack you will always find something to do. Combine multiple toys for a real sandbox experience.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/194641735156e1d34cafb8057daf9989.poster.avif?t=1752244843\" width=620 height=159 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/194641735156e1d34cafb8057daf9989.webm?t=1752244843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends for a playdate and watch your screen come to life. Unlock multiplayer mini games. Compete with and against your friends and their dragons.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/617662d3c3f6bda793834272ccbf59dc.poster.avif?t=1752244843\" width=620 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/617662d3c3f6bda793834272ccbf59dc.webm?t=1752244843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
